<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cho Bẻo Chăm nè 💖</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffecd2 0%, #fcb69f 100%);
            overflow: hidden;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            max-width: 420px;
            width: 100%;
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease;
        }

        .heart {
            font-size: 4rem;
            display: inline-block;
            animation: heartbeat 1.2s infinite;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #d6336c;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        @keyframes heartbeat {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box">
        <div class="heart">💖</div>
        <h1>Bẻo Chăm cố lên nha!</h1>
        <p>Làm mệt rồi thì nghỉ xíu nha Bẻo Chăm, Cần gì hay thèm gì nói tui nhaa tui tiếp năng lượng choa 🥰</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
